TODO: Watch MuJoCo on eth from my Mac.

1. Run: ssh -L 8080:localhost:8080 eth
2. Go to the remote quack folder.
3. Run: uv run play TASK_ID --wandb-run-path ENTITY/PROJECT/RUN_ID --viewer viser --num-envs 1
   Replace TASK_ID and ENTITY/PROJECT/RUN_ID with the real values.
4. Open http://localhost:8080 on my Mac. Keep SSH open.
